@host=https://tile-expert-test.local
@orderId=2

### Order with its articles
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json

### Not found -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/orders/999999
Accept: application/json

### Not a positive integer -> no route (404)
GET {{host}}/api/orders/abc
Accept: application/json
